### Test Sierra Games API Endpoints

### Get all games
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games
Accept: application/json

###

### Get games by series - King's Quest
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series/KQ
Accept: application/json

###

### Get games by series - Space Quest
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series/SQ
Accept: application/json

###

### Get games by series - Police Quest
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series/PQ
Accept: application/json

###

### Get games by series - Quest for Glory
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series/QFG
Accept: application/json

###

### Get games by series - Leisure Suit Larry
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series/LSL
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific game - King's Quest I (V3 data)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/kq1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific game - King's Quest I (V2 original data)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/kq1-original
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific game - Space Quest I (V3 data)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/sq1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific game - Quest for Glory V
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/qfg5
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all series info
GET http://localhost:8085/api/games/series
Accept: application/json

###

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8085/actuator/health
Accept: application/json